      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Copy the last element at root node .\n\n2. Reduce the array size by 1.\n\n3. Check whether the new root satisfies the\ncondition of heap or not .\n\n4. If yes then return .\n\n5. If no, then check whether the new root has\nany child or not .\n\n6. IF it has children then swap it with the\ngreater child and goto step 3 .\n\n7. If new root has no child return .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Copy the last element at root node .\n\n2. Reduce the array size by 1.\n\n3. Check whether the new root satisfies the condition of heap or not .\n\n4. If yes then return .\n\n5. If no, then check whether the new root has any child or not .\n\n6. IF it has children then swap it with the greater child and goto step 3 .\n\n7. If new root has no child return .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
